<view class="welcome-page">
  <view class="back-btn" bindtap="goBack">
    <image class="icon-img" src="/assets/profile-icons/arrowleft-dark.png" mode="aspectFit" />
  </view>

  <view class="logo-section">
    <view class="logo-icon-wrapper">
      <image class="logo-icon" src="/assets/logo.png" mode="aspectFit" />
    </view>
    <text class="logo-text">Miao</text>
  </view>
  <text class="main-title">遇见你的
数字猫咪</text>
  <text class="main-desc">开启一段温暖的治愈旅程，记录你与毛
孩子的每一个瞬间。</text>
  <view class="option-cards">
    <view class="option-card" bindtap="goUpload">
      <view class="card-header">
        <view class="card-icon-box"><image class="card-icon" src="/assets/profile-icons/camera-primary.png" mode="aspectFit" /></view>
        <text class="card-arrow">›</text>
      </view>
      <text class="card-title">我有猫咪</text>
      <text class="card-desc">上传照片，由 AI 为你的真实猫咪生成专属数字形象。</text>
      <view class="upload-hint"><text class="upload-hint-text">点击上传照片或视频</text></view>
    </view>
    <view class="option-card" bindtap="goCreate">
      <view class="card-header">
        <view class="card-icon-box"><image class="card-icon paw-icon" src="/assets/logo.png" mode="aspectFit" /></view>
        <text class="card-arrow">›</text>
      </view>
      <text class="card-title">我想养猫</text>
      <text class="card-desc">选择你心仪的品种，在数字世界领养你的第一只猫咪。</text>
    </view>
  </view>
  <view class="footer" bindlongtap="logout"><text class="footer-text">© 2026 MIAO · 纯粹的猫咪生活</text></view>
</view>
